{"version":1,"content":"<p>內地女星范冰冰近年將事業重心移至海外，在國際影壇發展得有聲有色，早前她在埃及為《第47屆開羅國際電影節》擔任評審，轉頭即飛往泰國清邁出席水燈節活動，並於昨日（25日）亮相大型花車巡遊。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T16:24:24.683136+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T16:01:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T16:17:34.987552+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T16:17:34.987552+00:00","content_hash":"c02c2b445d60b57afbe3188ed33ec3df643b27911bada43d982144f891a58260","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}